31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Your energy is quite surprising given the circumstances, Rin.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I have information. Rin is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. @Mizuki, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim right at the start. Are you trying to lead us, Mizuki?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! No way! Mizuki, why are you lying about me? I'm just a kid!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Mizuki is the Seer, the game ends today. If she's the werewolf, she's framing Rin.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I am the Seer. I divined Rin last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Mizuki is lying, she's risking a lot by claiming Seer so early.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,Or she's a very confident werewolf. But Rin's reaction is quite typical.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not a werewolf! Please believe me! Mizuki is just being mean!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, is there any reason you'd want to execute Rin specifically?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Only because she is the enemy. I have no personal reason to lie.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The logic favors Mizuki. A werewolf usually doesn't claim Seer on day one unless desperate.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm inclined to believe the Seer. It's the most efficient path to victory.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,No! This is unfair! You're all meanies!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will follow the evidence provided by the Seer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's vote and end this now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
